  DialogueNodeData:
  - Guid: 6d139e9a-dcc1-45f7-9d19-e9ed9c266c02
    DialogueText: Well, aren't you a sight for sore eyes.
    Position: {x: 187, y: 200}
  - Guid: 1281d269-c11f-48a1-8183-91f0875a904d
    DialogueText: Now, now, don't play coy. Tell me, do you ever get lonely out here
      all by yourself?
    Position: {x: 578, y: 50}
  - Guid: 650dc299-cb60-4f79-8a06-72233177f086
    DialogueText: Oh, everything is just to my liking. Do you ever get lonely out
      here all by yourself?
    Position: {x: 578, y: 206}
  - Guid: 3d40753c-64da-4357-8c83-93f5344c57da
    DialogueText: Tell me, hun, do you ever get lonely out here all by yourself?
    Position: {x: 579, y: 372}
  - Guid: e31f0bb2-cf21-4e52-a89d-91dc0d25d9c4
    DialogueText: Maybe I'll stick around then. Give you some company?
    Position: {x: 1250, y: 49}
  - Guid: 94966c1d-d873-40e1-9ae3-07e55d209f90
    DialogueText: Oh, you want to be alone, huh? You sure you don't want any company?
    Position: {x: 1247, y: 210}
  - Guid: 1a936d76-6a21-4823-8cea-5f178c0ff189
    DialogueText: Well, your body is definitely telling me "yes." Maybe I'll stick
      around, give you some company.
    Position: {x: 1248, y: 372}
  - Guid: c6d5da48-58f5-455b-95d2-29176a75c75d
    DialogueText: Nonsense. You have no idea how long I've been waiting to get you
      all alone.
    Position: {x: 1979, y: 43}
  - Guid: c4855537-f2a1-4f87-9c7a-cad626b9a2c5
    DialogueText: I'll just have to change your mind then. You have no idea how long
      I've been waiting to get you all alone.
    Position: {x: 1978, y: 210}
  - Guid: ac21741c-f8d1-4609-88a8-bfb5dfaa062e
    DialogueText: What's the matter? Cat got your tongue? Don't worry, I like 'em
      quiet. You have no idea how long I've been waiting to get you all alone.
    Position: {x: 1978, y: 372}
  - Guid: af93f235-b8f3-472c-bb2e-e406e04328c8
    DialogueText: Not quite, but I've been keeping a close eye on you for a while.
      Oh, the thing's I've dreamt about doing to you. And now you're here. Now you're
      mine.
    Position: {x: 2760, y: 25}
  - Guid: 51d1be4c-03cd-4c57-9b0e-b028c1d6887d
    DialogueText: Don't be like that, sweetie. I've been watching you for a while
      now.. Oh, the things I've dreamt about doing to you. And now you're here. Now
      you're mine.
    Position: {x: 2758, y: 195}
  - Guid: ed6c6f38-4f65-4e43-8166-16f525b9d881
    DialogueText: I've been watching you for a while now. Oh, the things I've dreamt
      about doing to you. And now you're here. Now you're mine.
    Position: {x: 2912, y: 373}
  - Guid: 301c581f-4662-4457-9959-b5f6686b82b2
    DialogueText: Now, hold on a moment, darling. Let's not make any rash decisions.
    Position: {x: 3784, y: 13}
  - Guid: 445d820a-059d-4bf9-8c8f-435d12a08ef0
    DialogueText: Don't play hard-to-get, love. You're not the one in charge here.
    Position: {x: 3801, y: 198}
  - Guid: 7ce00f99-aefb-473e-9e19-97f311d6521d
    DialogueText: Don't be shy. Come on, smile. Don't make me ask again.
    Position: {x: 3807, y: 363}
  - Guid: e1bf4905-0fd5-4661-b991-e5028e517db6
    DialogueText: Fine... Looks like playtime is over. I thought you'd last a little
      longer.
    Position: {x: 4422, y: 321}
  - Guid: acdf42cf-919c-4b84-85af-8790e0dcd2a1
    DialogueText: Ugh, fine. Looks like it's time to find a new toy. This one is
      boring.
    Position: {x: 4420, y: 120}
  ExposedProperties: []
  CommentBlockData: []
